{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":169,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"d2e315dd-0a38-43b4-a142-bd2915394db4","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151266886,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"解决方案岗（制造业）(J12974)","OrgId":2015255,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"一、岗位职责  \n1：客户界面与方案输出\n1.1调研客户现有模式及痛点（需求预测与测算、现有模式的诊断）\n1.2基于需求进行业务分析，阶段性方案调整汇报，引导客户选择公司有竞争力的系统解决方案\n1.3主导技术招投标工作及技术文件的谈判\n1.4对解决方案的质量负责（方案实现、细化质量、效率达成、验收条款）\n2：内部流程及资源推动\n2.1推动项目解决方案在公司内部通过（产品技术、方案风险、外采、降本、消防安全等评估）\n2.2输出满足内部质量要求的项目交接材料，组织完成方案交接\n2.3支持项目团队在交付过程中的方案优化和变更管理 \n2.4支持职能部门输出项目的案例资料、分析资料、行业分析等","Require":"任职要求\n学历与专业 ：本科及以上学历，自动化、工业工程、物流工程等相关专业优先 \n工作经验 ：\n3 年以上物流自动化或 AGV 相关行业从业经验，有仓库自动化设备规划经验\n了解常见自动化设备，至少具备一种自动化设备的规划经验（如 ACR、AGV、多穿等） \n有行业头部企业（如国内外汽车主机厂、京东物流、菜鸟、顺丰等）规划经验者优先。\n技能与能力 ：\n具备良好的数据分析、布局设计、流程设计能力，熟练使用 AUTOCAD、Visio、PPT 等软件 \n熟悉仓库作业流程、WMS 系统，有参与过仓库系统流程设计者优先 \n优秀的沟通、表达和团队协作能力，擅长思考和发现问题 \n具备较强的抗压能力","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-23T17:52:37","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"95ba27ce-a70a-4a6d-954d-8b62e2e6cc5d","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151266730,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"PIE工程师/PIE Engineer(J13205)","OrgId":553648,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"一、岗位职责：\n1、负责工厂效能相关指标核算及分析，包括工厂人力产能规划及推动执行，过程管理；\n2、负责工厂生产线的设备/工装治具的规划、ROI评审、实施、验收、优化、盘点和报废等全寿命流程管理； \n3、负责推动新产品的可制造性评估和优化，新产品导入制造的流程管理，保证低成本满足交付需求；\n4、推动工厂端到端的降本方案制定及过程管控，协助达成工厂成本经营目标达成；\n5、负责工厂 layout规划，产线布局及精益布局优化；\n6、推动其他部门开展精益改善、金点子改善等。","Require":"二、岗位要求：\n1、硕士学历，工业工程或机械自动化等相关专业；\n2、拥有制造业工厂实习经历，对从事机器人制造行业感兴趣；\n3、能独立思考、逻辑思维强、抗压能力强，沟通能力突出；\n4、能熟练使用Solidwork/CAD/Office/Minitab等软件；\n5、有成本意识，全局改善理念。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-23T14:41:47","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"d9a2b656-9a44-47f8-842b-da0c9b91f8db","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151266724,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"计划工程师/Planning Engineer(J13204)","OrgId":553648,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"一、岗位职责：\n1.对接销售端/PIC端进行预测与订单的信息收集、跟进、评审、订单生产地分配；\n2.根据预测与订单交付交期的评审承诺，制定主计划，跟进，异常协调与反馈；\n3.根据销售订单进行系统录入、维护，变更的及时跟进确认；\n4.售后需求的统筹、跟进、交期答复以及发货跟踪；\n5.拉通前后端进行策略性备料（长周期、非基线项目专用料）；\n6.OTD、交付周期数据分析，组织相关部门制定改善对策。","Require":"二、岗位要求\n1、全日制本科及以上学历，专业不限；\n2、通过英语六级；\n3、数字敏感，有一定的数据分析能力；\n4、性格外向喜交流，有较强的沟通及应变能力；","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-23T14:37:04","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"c642f5f8-04b0-4b81-b328-a22db4aad48e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151266714,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"订单管理工程师/Order Management Engineer(J13203)","OrgId":553648,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"一、岗位职责：\n1、对接一线销售及PM，参与项目交付时间节点的制定和管理，同时在项目转化为合同后，负责将客户合同需求转化成可履行的订单（含时间、配置、金额、地址等）并精准分发到供应节点（计划、生产、仓储、物流等）。统筹协调内部资源确保订单各交付环节承诺达成，满足客户需求。\n2、对内负责订单向下根据各环节交付的SLA达成的跟进及协调，同时监控订单交付各环节异常事件及风险点，推动内部解决问题，达成交付要求，另外要对影响订单交付的异常及时向各环节预警，提升客户满意度。\n3、负责管控订单备发货条件（预付款、交易条款、发货款、信用额度检查，L/C差异等），及时识别交易中的风险，避免交易损失。同时管理订未发，发未收等异常，支撑收入及时确认。","Require":"二、岗位要求\n1、硕士学历，专业不限；\n2、有企业供应链实习经历者优先；\n3、数字敏感，有一定的数据分析能力；\n4、性格外向喜交流，有较强的沟通及应变能力；\n5、英语可以作为工作语言。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-23T14:24:26","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"3362e92b-6f01-46a0-b1b6-475e74b3c1f2","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151266708,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"测试工程师/Test Engineer(J13202)","OrgId":553648,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"一、岗位职责：\n1、支持产品(PCBA及模块)生产维修能力导入，并通过及时识别产品设计、生产制程、物料质量方面的问题,推动前端环节进行预防和改进;\n2、负责产品(PCBA及模块)在工厂端的生产准备和导产支持，通过分析产品生产维修不良的问题,推动研发前端产品质量改进;\n3、负责产品(PCBA及模块)生产维修现场疑难问题处理(异常处理，交验不良，疑难单板维修等)，产品不良失效分析;\n4、对于电气件电机、相机、雷达等故障诊断能力建设，规划产品故障诊断和维修技术实现路标和实施;","Require":"二、岗位要求：\n1、硕士学历，电子、信息、自动化等相关专业；\n2、通过英语六级；熟悉电脑基本操作和Excel等常用办公软件，能够完成器件规格文档资料收集整理工作；\n3、掌握电路原理、模电数电、信号处理，了解常见电气设备和元器件主要功能；\n4、具有一定的电路图纸阅读和制作能力；\n5、具备优秀的逻辑思维能力及挑战精神，具有团队合作意识和风险意识。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-23T14:11:33","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"9b0934d5-fcc8-4939-bac4-15c3bc817612","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151266695,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"工艺工程师/Process Engineer(J13201)","OrgId":553648,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"一、岗位职责：\n1、负责制程产品的生产异常分析、处理（提供临时解决方案），追踪责任部门提供长久解决方案并跟进长久解决方案的落地;\n2、负责产品、生产设备的SOP制作；\n3、负责对产线所需的工装治具可行性评估、申请、验证及导入；\n4、协助开发工程师及新品导入组进行新产品的小批量试产，新物料&新工艺的验证；\n5、协助质量部制定产品检验标准，异常分析与改善；\n6、协助设计人员，保障项目与产品保质按时生产与交付","Require":"二、岗位要求\n1、硕士学历，机械自动化、机电一体化相关专业；\n2、有较强的动手能力及良好的机械测绘能力，有参加过机器人及类似比赛经验优先；\n3、通过英语六级；熟